# Example environment variables for frontend
# Development (local):
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5001
#
# Production: set this in Railway or your CI before building:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-production-domain

# Notes:
# - `VITE_API_URL` should be the backend host (no trailing `/api`).
# - The app will call `${VITE_API_URL}/api/...` at runtime.
